    "body": "Please also update this to set the value if `__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select` was not unset, to avoid inadvertently replacing the actual contents with `starship_zle-keymap-select-wrapped`. This could also be used to avoid installing the wrapper if the value is `starship_zle-keymap-select`.",
