    "body": "I think something like below could account for that. I would also prefer not defining a wrapper function unless needed:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select_capture=${widgets[zle-keymap-select]#user:}\r\nif [[ -n $__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select_capture && $__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select_capture != \"starship_zle-keymap-select-wrapped\" &&  $__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select_capture != \"starship_zle-keymap-select\" ]]; then\r\n     __starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select=$__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select_capture\r\nelse\r\n    __starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select=\"\"\r\nfi\r\n\r\nif [[ -z $__starship_preserved_zle_keymap_select ]]; then\r\n    zle -N zle-keymap-select starship_zle-keymap-select;\r\nelse\r\n# ....\r\n```",
